message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "oeds-kit: modular extensions of the Open Energy Data Server"
abstract: >-
  Crawler pack, scheduler with administration interface, post-processing and
  deployment for the Open Energy Data Server (OEDS), in one repository. It
  builds on oeds-core, a modified copy of the OEDS core, pinned in uv.lock.
type: software
version: 1.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/johannesschuhmacher/oeds-kit"
